{
  "abstract": "Invariant mass spectrum of \u03bc + \u03bc \u2212 pairs produced by 70 GeV/ c protons in Be target are presented. Distinct enhancements in the mass regions of \u03f1, \u03c9 mesons, \u03c6 meson and J/\u03c8 particle are observed. For J/\u03c8 production x and p \u22a5 2 distributions are given. The total cross section for the reaction p + Be \u2192 ( J \u03c8 \u2192 \u03bc + \u03bc \u2212 ) + \u2026 is equal to 9.5 \u00b1 2.5 nb/nucleus .",
